You see people for who they are and you can always find the good in them.

257
00:18:16,180 --> 00:18:18,180
I suppose that's why you have that magic.

258
00:18:19,180 --> 00:18:21,180
It's because I like people?

259
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:24,180
You can't use it without first observing and understanding someone.

260
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:26,180
It means you're kind.

261
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:29,180
You thought I was kind, but you were wrong.

262
00:18:30,180 --> 00:18:33,180
Not only am I disloyal, I'm a lazy, worthless liar.

263
00:18:34,180 --> 00:18:37,180
But Ligt said so many wonderful things about me.

264
00:18:37,180 --> 00:18:39,180
He was truly the kind one.

265
00:18:39,180 --> 00:18:42,180
And when you people deceived him and killed him,

266
00:18:42,180 --> 00:18:46,180
an unfathomable amount of anger and hate welled up inside of me.

267
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:50,180
Your time has come, you foul humans!

268
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:52,180
I'm going to slaughter every one of you!

269
00:18:52,180 --> 00:19:02,180
So it was just for sure.

270
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:05,180
You can't copy anti-magic after all.

271
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:09,180
She thought it might be real and she still punched me without hesitation.

272
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:13,180
If I could use anti-magic, it would have destroyed that fist of hers.

273
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:15,180
And such intense mana.

274
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:17,180
This woman's incredible.

275
00:19:17,180 --> 00:19:20,180
It's not just because she's royal.

276
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:23,180
This is a human strength we've never known.

277
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:26,180
Are you done playing around?

278
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:28,180
Now then.

279
00:19:29,180 --> 00:19:32,180
She's gone beyond mana scape to control all the mana in the area.

280
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,180
It's time to end this!

281
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:38,180
Monozone.

282
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:41,180
Calidos Brachium Barrage!

283
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:56,180
What's wrong, Mr. Third Eye? Running out of spells?

284
00:20:01,180 --> 00:20:02,180
Yeah, he's finished.

285
00:20:02,180 --> 00:20:06,180
There's no time to use fast movement or recovery magic.

286
00:20:07,180 --> 00:20:08,180
What can I do now?

287
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:11,180
I had no idea she'd mastered a Monozone attack.

288
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:13,180
With the Monozone ability,

289
00:20:14,180 --> 00:20:19,180
the user is able to manipulate the mana in the surrounding area to suit his or her own purposes.

290
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:24,180
This means that any mana using techniques activated within that zone can be controlled as well.

291
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:26,180
Try another attack!

292
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:28,180
I dare you!

293
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:29,180
No!

294
00:20:29,180 --> 00:20:32,180
Additionally, Monozone gives a massive boost to sensitivity and reaction speed.

295
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:36,180
Borrowing power from nearby mana, one can move freely through the air.

296
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:38,180
She's too good.

297
00:20:38,180 --> 00:20:39,180
It's getting ridiculous.

298
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:43,180
We struggled so hard to beat the Third Eye and now look!

299
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:47,180
Captain Mary Leona, you're so strong!

300
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:52,180
If that's really your best, I'll punch you until you're a pile of ashes!

301
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:53,180
Now burn!

302
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:57,180
Well, I guess that's it for me.

303
00:20:57,180 --> 00:21:08,180
Wind magic! Tornado fang times three!

304
00:21:09,180 --> 00:21:10,180
Huh?

305
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:15,180
Sorry, but you can't defeat me.

306
00:21:16,180 --> 00:21:17,180
You don't have what it takes.

307
00:21:18,180 --> 00:21:19,180
Nice one, you know!

308
00:21:20,180 --> 00:21:22,180
His magic came from behind them!

309
00:21:23,180 --> 00:21:25,180
Could that be the ability they call Monozone?

310
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:36,180
Now that I think about it, he cast a spell inside another spell earlier, and Spirit Dive, he used Monozone to do it!

311
00:21:36,180 --> 00:21:40,180
Yuno really is an outstanding magic night!

312
00:21:45,180 --> 00:21:46,180
Do you hear that?

313
00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:49,180
I heard it before, too.

314
00:21:50,180 --> 00:21:51,180
A heartbeat?

315
00:21:54,180 --> 00:21:56,180
The mana here feels so... familiar.

316
00:22:06,180 --> 00:22:11,180
It is gone...

317
00:22:11,180 --> 00:22:39,060
I don't need no money

318
00:22:39,060 --> 00:22:42,200
I don't need no魔力はいらない

319
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:45,160
自力で挑んだミラクル起きること願い

320
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:48,260
微力ながら1ミリずつビリビリ切り込んでく

321
00:22:48,260 --> 00:22:49,860
世界を巻き込んでく

322
00:22:49,860 --> 00:22:51,940
My disability is my ability

323
00:22:51,940 --> 00:22:54,360
逆にそれが俺のエネルギー

324
00:22:54,360 --> 00:23:00,460
どうしても自らを見失って

325
00:23:00,460 --> 00:23:06,680
嫌いになって負けそうになったら

326
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:09,840
Just cry out loud

327
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:11,260
傷つく音に

328
00:23:11,260 --> 00:23:13,380
傷つく音に

329
00:23:13,380 --> 00:23:16,780
勝ち向かう勇気へと導いてく

330
00:23:16,780 --> 00:23:17,460
Our treasure

331
00:23:17,460 --> 00:23:19,280
うなぎらないのは

332
00:23:19,280 --> 00:23:21,860
最後に there is love

333
00:23:21,860 --> 00:23:24,500
かざしたちがい光が

334
00:23:24,500 --> 00:23:25,200
にぎる

335
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:37,320
The Royal Knights, huh?

336
00:23:37,840 --> 00:23:40,100
I might as well play with them a little longer

337
00:23:40,100 --> 00:23:42,300
Black Clover, page 92

338
00:23:42,300 --> 00:23:46,040
The Wizard King versus the Leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun

339
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:47,300
Go on, Licht

340
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:49,420
Crush that Wizard King for good

341
00:23:49,420 --> 00:23:59,420
ご視聴ありがとうございました

